    "message": "[ipa-delivery:749] build the private test IPA 749: S2Arm engine patches 0001-0036 (pin 83470e1f), on base 748\n\nFrozen manifest 749 (freeze commit e2e7f433, effective digest 5028c81a): the\nverified IPA 748 product with the S2Arm engine of patches 0001-0036 (run\n43646892889, artifact 14134846699, verified pin 83470e1f): controller and\ntouch reach the game again, pipelines kept across starts, masked multi-draws\ncovered (0033-0034); terrain height tiles taken from their storage and\nguest memory in 1 GB files for Mario Kart World (0035-0036). RPCS3 Core\n938, MeloNX Core 030cc14f, XeniaCore and every retained component are those\nof the base. Images that must change: S2ArmEngine and Runner. Build-only\ndelivery: Flutter/native groups not-run. Nothing has run on an iPhone; no\nframe rate, stability or heat claim.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012mUAShv9k6pSCnpW7oAF63",
